#Протокол_Operator_Agent_Run_Panel_v1<[
Базис:
  Старый ioHasC agent panel (Monaco-side chat, tool picker, free-form orchestrator) не переносится 1:1.
  Work Graph rebuild заменяет его operator Agent Run panel: task-bound worker execution через runtime/API, а не свободный чат.
  Provider registry v1 и selection/fallback runtime уже описаны; UI показывает worker runs и runner queue, но не даёт launch/stop actions.
Вектор:
  Agent Run panel — секция operator dashboard «Агент» с:
  - task selector (ready queue / runner queue / explicit task id)
  - provider selector (MVP: local, openai; later: auto/cursor-sdk/claude-sdk-api badges from registry)
  - policy preset (dry-run default, optional verification mode)
  - Run / Cancel actions
  - live run log (steps: observe→plan→claim→act→verify→record→stop)
  - Worker Output preview (patchSummary, evidence, transitionRequest, failureReason)
  - fallback trail view when usedFallback=true
  Все state-changing actions идут через POST /api/agent-run (server-side live-loop), не через client-side backlog mutation.
Цель:
  Оператор получает замену старого agent window в архитектуре Work Graph executor без возврата к monolithic chat UX.

Проверки:
  MVP API contract documented below
  no shell/file-write from browser client
  cancel is best-effort on in-flight HTTP run (later: run handle + abort)
  planned providers visible but disabled until implement-* tasks close

