#Замена_старого_agent_panel<[
Базис:
  Старый agent panel = free chat + orchestrator tools + Monaco context.
  Rebuild = task-scoped worker runs with evidence gates.
Вектор:
  | Старый ioHasC | Agent Run panel replacement |
  |---|---|
  | Free-form chat input | Task selector + optional nextAction hint |
  | Model picker in settings | Provider selector per run |
  | Tool calls from orchestrator | Worker Input allowedTools + policy preset |
  | Chat history | worker-runs.jsonl + run log steps |
  | Apply edits inline | transitionRequest review + runtime gates |
Цель:
  Replacement scope явный; оператор не ищет «чат», а запускает worker run на WorkItem.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  protocol.id: operator-agent-run-panel-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#API_Contract_MVP<[
Базис:
  implement-operator-agent-run-panel-mvp реализует этот контракт в workGraphBacklogUiServer.mjs.
Вектор:
  GET /api/worker-provider-catalog — buildWorkerProviderCatalog() (implemented + planned providers).
  GET /api/agent-run/journal — readWorkerRunJournal() recent entries.
  POST /api/agent-run — body: { taskId?, provider?, policyPreset?, enableFallback?, persistBacklog? }; server calls runAgentWorkerLiveLoopFromBacklogFile(); returns { ok, workerRunSummary, workerOutput, steps, providerResult, appliedTransition, persistedBacklog, persistBacklogError }.
  По умолчанию persistBacklog=true: после успешного appliedTransition server патчит один WorkItem atom в work/backlog.bvc (implement-agent-run-backlog-persist); opt-out persistBacklog=false для tests/CLI.
  Client renders #agent-run-panel with data-testid hooks for E2E.
Цель:
  UI и CLI используют один live-loop path; mandatory CI остаётся без real LLM.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: operator-agent-run-api-v1
  protocol.id: operator-agent-run-panel-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#MVP_vs_Later<[
Базис:
  MVP не блокируется на cursor-sdk/claude providers.
Вектор:
  MVP:
  - task selector from runner queue
  - provider: local | openai | auto (capability selection)
  - one-shot run + journal refresh
  - Worker Output + fallback trail display
  Later:
  - cursor-sdk / claude-sdk-api enabled when implemented
  - cancel in-flight run handle
  - cost/latency badges from registry hints
  - role-chain handoff picker
Цель:
  MVP и later controls разделены; backlog implement task scoped to MVP only.

